    "long_instructions": "# Plan Your Data Collection\r\n\r\nIn this level, you’ll plan how to collect the data needed to answer your question responsibly.\r\n\r\nComplete pages 5 and 6 of your Project Planning Guide. Use AI Tutor to help you:\r\n\r\n- identify the data you need\r\n- choose an appropriate collection method\r\n- consider participants’ privacy and well-being\r\n- review and improve your plan\r\n\r\nDecide which feedback to use, then record your final decisions in `project_plan.txt`.\r\n\r\nUse your plan to begin creating your survey, interview guide, observation form, or other data-collection tool in a teacher-approved format.\r\n\r\n:::details [**Not Sure Where To Start?**]\r\n\r\nShare your data question with AI Tutor. Ask it to:\r\n\r\n- help you identify useful data and possible sources\r\n- compare appropriate collection methods\r\n- identify privacy, well-being, or representation concerns\r\n- review your ideas without creating the entire plan for you\r\n\r\n:::",
